  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice brown onion.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion, stirring, until softened, 4-5 mins. Reduce heat to medium.\n• Stir in the balsamic vinegar, brown sugar and a splash of water. Cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 mins. Transfer to a bowl and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6927a097d4fb0344016326f3/step-2bf5d600.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Pat haloumi dry, then slice into 1cm-thick slices.\n• Wipe out frying pan and return over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden, 1-2 mins each side.\n• Remove from heat. Add the honey and turn haloumi to coat. Transfer to a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6927a097d4fb0344016326f3/step-7e2ef010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, microwave mini flour tortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.\n• In a large bowl, combine salad leaves, cabbage mix, smokey aioli and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6927a097d4fb0344016326f3/step-11f80120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fill tortillas with creamy slaw, haloumi and caramelised onions to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6927a097d4fb0344016326f3/step-577c3330.jpg"
    }
  ]
